        "notes": "Imported from mim-queue (source_id=mediadive.ingredient:1977); no CAS-RN or CHEBI/NCIT match. Curator review needed. Reviewed on 2026-05-11 as a chromium potassium sulfate hydrate shorthand; left unmapped pending exact formula/CAS evidence.",
