            "changes": "Class-level label. MeSH:D054813 'Polyhydroxyalkanoates' is the closest term but does not carry this label as a synonym, and the 'beta' is a specificity the class term drops. Needs a granularity decision. Searched CHEBI, NCIT, FOODON, ENVO, MeSH, BTO and UBERON by label and synonym with normalisation, plus exact queries across all of live OLS4.",
